{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2022-04-26 16:01:00', 'title': 'TI REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS AND SHAREHOLDER RETURNS', 'text': "DALLAS , APRIL 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TEXAS INSTRUMENTS INCORPORATED (TI) (NASDAQ: TXN) TODAY REPORTED FIRST QUARTER REVENUE OF $4.91 BILLION, NET INCOME OF $2.20 BILLION AND EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $2.35. EARNINGS PER SHARE INCLUDED A 2-CENT BENEFIT FOR ITEMS THAT WERE NOT IN THE COMPANY'S ORIGINAL GUIDANCE."}